Inspect managed devices

Usage:
  olr devices show [command]

Available Commands:
  capabilities Inspect one device's capabilities
  config       Show the device inventory
  contract     Show versioned device schemas
  fdb          Locate a known MAC on a device
  operation    Preview disconnecting one wireless client
  scan         Listen for neighbouring access points on one radio
  snapshot     Read one device

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr devices show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
